{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for fans of classic boomer shooters and old-school campaigns, Melted Valor\u2122 delivers fast-paced, no-nonsense single-player action without the grind, frustration, or distractions of modern multiplayer. Just pure, adrenaline-fueled gameplay\u2014nothing fancy, just fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Melted Valor\u2122, the peaceful days of the Green Forces are over. Once guardians of the neighborhood\u2019s harmony, they now find themselves pressed into a brutal conflict against the relentless Tan menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tan have turned to sinister methods\u2014manipulating local bug tribes through toxic chemicals, bending them into weapons of war, and conscripting other toys from across the community: robots, action figures, dolls, all forced into their ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To an outsider, they may look like toys. But to them, this is no game. This is an unforgiving war\u2014one that will decide the future of their world. Every skirmish, every lost comrade, every hard-fought victory carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Green Forces must fight to protect their homes, their friends, and their way of life before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a desperate struggle across backyards, bedrooms, and beyond\u2026 the fate of the neighborhood is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Shattered Sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/3ef56211da3224339239e5897c155bd8713b31d1.jpg"},{"name":"Private","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/cccb4dfbf3482ffdac18d20103f6adf9a883e1b9.jpg"},{"name":"Sleeper Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/51fa6db58a5edc1fb11b582fa79e915b1e8566a5.jpg"},{"name":"Corporal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/0885c57d34e8e56c628ccc0c2d2e33a1ecd64a30.jpg"},{"name":"Tan Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/21a7710031b43e63e6e3233b1caf3556c42bad03.jpg"},{"name":"Toy Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/028caa3523b39ea8f113a0a10f641350d90da8d7.jpg"},{"name":"Toy Torturer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/67271ec322ca9224af5cf3711509b2a86dd3644a.jpg"},{"name":"Roach Smasher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/054dc1bbfff6484bdddff9bca269c01aab4469d5.jpg"},{"name":"Regicide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/959017520813447297eea13a28d716c3dae8600b.jpg"},{"name":"Sting Operation successful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949190/69a2f5069e25f6f5fa4dbcc3810d09991014cb32.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949190?t=1766012349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949190/784f60131d8ab50c3349cd104b23945234f5c53c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766012349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949190/b3c4dd86257a769b728e528945be6fb0e253129f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766012349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949190/b3c4dd86257a769b728e528945be6fb0e253129f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766012349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for fans of classic boomer shooters and old-school campaigns, Melted Valor\u2122 delivers fast-paced, no-nonsense single-player action without the grind, frustration, or distractions of modern multiplayer. Just pure, adrenaline-fueled gameplay\u2014nothing fancy, just fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Melted Valor\u2122, the peaceful days of the Green Forces are over. Once guardians of the neighborhood\u2019s harmony, they now find themselves pressed into a brutal conflict against the relentless Tan menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tan have turned to sinister methods\u2014manipulating local bug tribes through toxic chemicals, bending them into weapons of war, and conscripting other toys from across the community: robots, action figures, dolls, all forced into their ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To an outsider, they may look like toys. But to them, this is no game. This is an unforgiving war\u2014one that will decide the future of their world. Every skirmish, every lost comrade, every hard-fought victory carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Green Forces must fight to protect their homes, their friends, and their way of life before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a desperate struggle across backyards, bedrooms, and beyond\u2026 the fate of the neighborhood is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Code 33 Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949190/779dd4f3018ddb0a2ee6ee8c81e76113c5f4a693/header.jpg?t=1766012349","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Melted Valor\u2122 is created and published by Code 33 Productions\u2122.<br><br>\u00a9 [20